    {
      "source": "<dt>Overrides:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html#getQueryLookupStrategy(org.springframework.data.repository.query.QueryLookupStrategy.Key,org.springframework.data.repository.query.ValueExpressionDelegate)\">getQueryLookupStrategy</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\">RepositoryFactorySupport</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>key</code> - can be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>valueExpressionDelegate</code> - will never be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the <a href=\"../../query/QueryLookupStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryLookupStrategy</code></a> to use or null if no queries should be looked up.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.4</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>覆盖：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html#getQueryLookupStrategy(org.springframework.data.repository.query.QueryLookupStrategy.Key,org.springframework.data.repository.query.ValueExpressionDelegate)\">getQueryLookupStrategy</a></code> 方法，位于类 <code><a href=\"RepositoryFactorySupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\">RepositoryFactorySupport</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>key</code> - 可以为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>valueExpressionDelegate</code> - 永远不会为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>要使用的 <a href=\"../../query/QueryLookupStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryLookupStrategy</code></a>，或者如果不应查找任何查询则为 null。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>3.4</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
